      "statement": "OIFS supports five compression modes: Always (compress all data regardless of size), Never (store data uncompressed with compressed_size = 0), Auto (default: compress when data size >= 8KB and only if compression reduces size), Stream (full-file stream compression with explicit Zstd compression level), and Seekable (seekable chunked compression with 64KB independent chunks and explicit Zstd level).",
